# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，避免 Windows 上 CRLF 来回污染
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：明确禁止任何换行符转换
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# 语言与标记
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf

# GitHub 语言统计：本项目主体是内容而非代码，不计入 HTML 统计
md/       linguist-vendored
papers/   linguist-vendored
